{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"0ac80947d6bb3cfe","__entryId":"split-screen-layout","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-height:128px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">把工作室装进一个页面</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:.75\">项目、文件和收款，都在同一个地方。</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 10px;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:4px\">了解服务</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">登录</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--text-3)\">邮箱</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--text-3)\">密码</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center\">进入工作台</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">个人版</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">自由职业者与小型项目</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">免费开始 · 随时升级</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center;margin-top:2px\">创建个人空间</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">企业版</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">权限、审计与专属支持</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">按席位计费</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--brand);color:var(--brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center;margin-top:2px\">预约演示</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">方案 A · 按年付</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:4px 0\">¥ 99<span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:400\"> / 月</span></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">含全部模板与 100G 空间</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">方案 B · 按月付</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:4px 0\">¥ 128<span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:400\"> / 月</span></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">同样功能，按月灵活取消</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-height:120px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg-soft);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">先自己试试</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">14 天完整功能，不需要信用卡</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;align-self:flex-start\">在线试用</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">找人讲讲</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">30 分钟演示，回答你的问题</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;align-self:flex-start;color:var(--text-2)\">预约演示</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"left\"><span class=\"split-anat-half\"><span class=\"split-anat-title\">区域 A</span><span class=\"split-anat-line\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"action\"><span class=\"split-anat-action on\">动作</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"right\"><span class=\"split-anat-half alt\"><span class=\"split-anat-title\">区域 B</span><span class=\"split-anat-line\"></span><span class=\"split-anat-action\">动作</span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"left\"><span class=\"split-anat-half\"><span class=\"split-anat-title\">Area A</span><span class=\"split-anat-line\"></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"action\"><span class=\"split-anat-action on\">Action</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"right\"><span class=\"split-anat-half alt\"><span class=\"split-anat-title\">Area B</span><span class=\"split-anat-line\"></span><span class=\"split-anat-action\">Action</span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"left","cn":"并列区域 A","en":"Parallel Area A","desc":"约占一半宽度，独立承载一个任务或入口","desc_en":"Takes about half the width and carries its own task or entry"},{"key":"right","cn":"并列区域 B","en":"Parallel Area B","desc":"与 A 权重接近；拿掉任何一边都少完成一件事","desc_en":"Similar weight to A; removing either side loses a real task"},{"key":"action","cn":"各自的动作","en":"Separate Actions","desc":"每边有自己的标题和动作，这是与左图右文的分界","desc_en":"Each side has its own headline and action, unlike a decorative image-plus-text pair"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"等宽分屏","en":"Even Split","demo":"<span style=\"display:flex;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:flex;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","when":"两个任务权重相同，例如两类用户入口","when_en":"When both tasks carry equal weight, such as two audience entries"},{"cn":"轻偏分屏","en":"Slightly Offset","demo":"<span style=\"display:flex;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\" style=\"flex:1.4\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:flex;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\" style=\"flex:1.4\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","when":"一边内容更重，但另一边仍是独立任务","when_en":"When one side holds more content but the other remains a real task"},{"cn":"上下堆叠","en":"Stacked","demo":"<span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:110px;gap:4px\"><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i><i class=\"split-v-half\"></i></span>","when":"手机端默认形态，任务区在前","when_en":"The default phone form, with the task area first"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>登录 / 注册页</b>：一侧品牌传达，一侧完成表单","m":"split-use-login"},{"t":"两类用户入口：个人版 / 企业版、买家 / 卖家各占一半","m":"split-use-audience"},{"t":"产品双路径：在线试用与预约演示并列呈现","m":"split-use-paths"},{"t":"两个方案或版本需要同屏对照，权重接近","m":"split-use-compare"}],"dont":[{"t":"一边只是装饰图、另一边才是唯一任务：<b>那是左图右文</b>，不是分屏","m":"split-dont-decoration","bad":true},{"t":"两边权重悬殊：主内容配窄导航应使用 {c:sidebar-layout}","m":"split-dont-sidebar","bad":true},{"t":"手机端保留左右分屏：<b>文字和按钮被压窄</b>，应改成上下排列","m":"split-dont-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"两块都塞满内容：首屏变成两个拥挤的页面，焦点互相争抢","m":"split-dont-crowded","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"产品登录页左侧放品牌故事、右侧放登录表单，两边各占一半。AI 交付的手机版仍是左右排列，文字和按钮都被压窄。怎样处理？","options":[{"id":"stack-form-first","label":"手机端改成上下排列，登录表单在上、品牌区在后，再检查输入和按钮可用","feedback":"上下排列保住可读宽度；表单是用户打开登录页要完成的任务，放在前面。","correct":true},{"id":"shrink-side-by-side","label":"保留左右结构，把两个区域等比缩小到手机屏幕宽度","feedback":"等比缩小会把输入框和按钮压到难以操作，手机端需要重新排列而不是缩放桌面布局。","correct":false},{"id":"drop-brand-side","label":"手机端直接删掉品牌区，只保留登录表单","feedback":"品牌区在新访客首次访问时承担建立信任的任务；应先尝试上下重排，确认可省再删。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A product login page puts a brand story on the left half and the login form on the right. The delivered mobile version keeps the side-by-side layout, squeezing text and buttons. What should you do?","options":[{"id":"stack-form-first","label":"Stack the two areas on mobile with the login form first, then verify inputs and buttons stay usable","feedback":"Stacking restores readable width; the form is the task visitors came to complete, so it leads.","correct":true},{"id":"shrink-side-by-side","label":"Keep the two columns and scale both areas down proportionally to fit the phone","feedback":"Proportional shrinking crushes inputs and buttons; mobile needs rearrangement, not a scaled-down desktop layout.","correct":false},{"id":"drop-brand-side","label":"Remove the brand area on phones and keep only the login form","feedback":"The brand area builds trust for first-time visitors; try restacking first and remove it only when it is proven dispensable.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"把登录页做成分屏：左半屏品牌介绍带一个「了解服务」入口，右半屏登录表单，两边任务并列、视觉权重接近。手机端改成上下排列，表单在前。改完后用桌面和手机各检查一次：两边是否都像一个独立任务，手机上输入框和按钮是否可用。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Make the login page a split-screen: the left half carries the brand intro with a “Learn more” entry, the right half carries the login form; both sides are parallel tasks with similar visual weight. On phones, stack them vertically with the form first. Then check on desktop and mobile: does each side read as its own task, and are inputs and buttons usable on the phone."}},"references":[{"title":"CSS 布局 cookbook","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/How_to/Layout_cookbook","title_en":"CSS layout cookbook"},{"title":"Flexbox 的基本概念","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_flexible_box_layout/Basic_concepts_of_flexbox","title_en":"Basic concepts of flexbox"}],"scenes":["品牌登录页","个人 / 企业入口","双方案对比","试用与演示入口"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Login and signup pages: brand story on one side, the form on the other","m":"split-use-login"},{"t":"Two audience entries: personal vs business, buyer vs seller","m":"split-use-audience"},{"t":"Two product paths: start a trial vs book a demo","m":"split-use-paths"},{"t":"Two plans or versions compared side by side at similar weight","m":"split-use-compare"}],"dont":[{"t":"One side is only a decorative image while the other holds the only task","m":"split-dont-decoration","bad":true},{"t":"A wide content area with a narrow sidebar is a sidebar layout instead","m":"split-dont-sidebar","bad":true},{"t":"Keeping the side-by-side split on phones until text and buttons shrink","m":"split-dont-mobile","bad":true},{"t":"Cramming both halves full until the first screen becomes two crowded pages","m":"split-dont-crowded","bad":true}],"scenes":["Brand login","Personal vs business","Plan comparison","Trial vs demo"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-height:128px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Your studio in one page</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:.75\">Projects, files, and payments in one place.</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 10px;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:4px\">Learn more</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">Sign in</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--text-3)\">Email</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;color:var(--text-3)\">Password</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center\">Open workspace</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Personal</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">For freelancers and small projects</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Free to start · upgrade anytime</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center;margin-top:2px\">Create a space</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Business</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Permissions, audit, and support</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Per-seat pricing</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--brand);color:var(--brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;text-align:center;margin-top:2px\">Book a demo</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Plan A · Annual</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:4px 0\">$14<span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:400\"> / mo</span></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">All templates and 100 GB storage</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Plan B · Monthly</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:4px 0\">$18<span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-weight:400\"> / mo</span></div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Same features, cancel anytime</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-height:120px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg-soft);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Try it yourself</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Full features for 14 days, no card required</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;align-self:flex-start\">Start a trial</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:6px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">Talk to someone</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">A 30-minute demo with your questions answered</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 10px;align-self:flex-start;color:var(--text-2)\">Book a demo</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"distinctions":[{"label":"Sidebar Layout","text":"In {c:sidebar-layout} the sidebar is navigation with clearly less weight than the workspace; in {c:split-screen-layout} both sides carry near-equal, independent tasks.","targetId":"sidebar-layout"},{"label":"Image plus text","text":"In an image-plus-text row the image only serves the text; in {c:split-screen-layout} each side carries its own task or entry, and removing either one loses a real job."}]},"usageMocks":{"split-use-login":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"display:flex;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"flex:1;background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:10px\">品牌介绍</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;padding:10px;color:var(--text-2)\">登录表单</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">一侧品牌，一侧表单</span>","split-use-audience":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">个人版</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">企业版</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">两类用户各占一半入口</span>","split-use-paths":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">在线试用</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">预约演示</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">两条路径并列呈现</span>","split-use-compare":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"display:flex;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;padding:8px;color:var(--text-2);border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">方案 A · 按年付</span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;padding:8px;color:var(--text-2)\">方案 B · 按月付</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">两个方案同屏对照</span>","split-dont-decoration":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"display:flex;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg-soft)\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;padding:10px;color:var(--text-2)\">全部内容都在右侧</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">一边只是装饰图，不是分屏</span>","split-dont-sidebar":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"display:flex;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"width:34px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-right:1px solid var(--border)\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;padding:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">主从悬殊应使用左侧栏布局</span>","split-dont-mobile":"<div style=\"display:flex;width:90px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"flex:1;background:#1d2129;height:36px\"></span><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);height:36px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">手机上左右分屏被压窄</span>","split-dont-crowded":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"display:flex;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"flex:1;padding:6px;border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></span><span style=\"flex:1;padding:6px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">两边都塞满，焦点互相争抢</span>"}}}